title: "SCPTM-bow: structure-aware topic modelling without neural embeddings"
abstract: >-
  Dependency-regularised non-negative matrix factorisation over a lemmatised
  bag of words, with fastText vectors and multiword-expression extraction. The
  deterministic, CPU-only counterpart to SCPTM.
